er": "role", "category": "obligation", "kind": "obligation.opened", "role": "idea-repo", "actor": "dispatcher", "execution_id": null, "trust": "system-confirmed", "outcome": "open", "ambiguous_order": true, "label": "opened request:idea-repo#9 v1", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [{"ref": "addeed4d-38db-54ff-9bb4-b12d15bd3cbd", "relation": "caused-by", "trust": "system-confirmed"}], "obligation": {"key": "request:idea-repo#9", "kind": "request", "version": 1, "change": "opened", "cause": "opened", "source": "forgejo"}, "summary": "now owes request:idea-repo#9 “Review of Brief rev. 7: two claims ahead of the evidence (better inference; misfit label)” (v1, opened)"}, {"id": "63b8e5b4-fa18-56d4-91a4-189f919487a2", "at": 1795731976.834126, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 27945, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "idea-review-repo", "actor": "idea-review-repo", "execution_id": "851258b4f37d56ceca02a52011a21f3b", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "3fee6f5e-3470-5fc9-a822-f15b75b04aab", "at": 1795731976.8412359, "until": 1795731976.9767818, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 27946, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.agent_message_chunk", "role": "idea-review-repo", "actor": "idea-review-repo", "execution_id": "851258b4f37d56ceca02a52011a21f3b", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "message (59 chunks)", "shown": {"message": "I re-reviewed Brief rev. 7 and opened `idea-repo`#9 with two points. Overall the handling of the interim results is sound.\n- **What is sound:** the failed rank claim and the failed spectrum-based k\\* rule are reported as findings. The margin flaw is owned, both verdict scales are kept, and the headline is tied to the common-target-set rerun.\n- **\"Better inference would help\":** Decision 6 ends by saying better inference, not better selection, is what would help. No result tests this yet, and the inference-rule table hasn't been run on the primary score. I asked for it to be stated as a hypothesis or made conditional on that table.\n- **\"Estimation misfit\" label:** the 11.0 term is a residual that mixes finite-M estimation error with misspecification. I asked for the label \"residual (estimation + misspecification)\" until the known-truth synthetic runs at the same M separate the two.\n\nNeither blocks anything. I'll re-review when the Brief or Outline next changes materially."}}, {"id": "daabfa73-429f-578e-8042-e6f2f1c156e1", "at": 1795731976.9792771, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 28006, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "idea-review-repo", "actor": "idea-review-repo", "execution_id": "851258b4f37d56ceca02a52011a21f3b", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "93dbeda6-352d-5ec3-a596-cc0734102c4f", "at": 1795731976.9815822, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 28007, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.response", "role": "idea-review-repo", "actor": "idea-review-repo", "execution_id": "851258b4f37d56ceca02a52011a21f3b", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": "end_turn", "label": "message → end_turn", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "response"}, {"id": "a486d655-1304-5791-9caa-c137ba5a4133", "at": 1795731976.9833899, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 28008, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.session_info_update", "role": "idea-review-repo", "actor": "idea-review-repo", "execution_id": "851258b4f37d56ceca02a52011a21f3b", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "session_info_up